            "url": "{{api_url}}/internal/v1/declarations/{{ana_id}}",
            "description": "Al menos 5 tags del vocabulario del módulo (GET {{demo_url}}/demo/tags?module=peliculas). Pide el recálculo al worker.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"module\": \"peliculas\",\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"terror\",\n    \"sobrenatural\",\n    \"suspenso\",\n    \"misterio\",\n    \"drama\"\n  ]\n}",
