      "name": "3. Sync de api-general (lo que lee el Data Transformer)",
      "description": "Contrato api-general-sync: páginas con snapshot_id, total y next_page_token. Requieren la API key.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Usuarios",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
